<mxfile host="drawio"><diagram id="multi-host" name="multi-host"><mxGraphModel dx="1000" dy="400" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1000" pageHeight="400" background="#ffffff" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c3" value="여러 PC에 동시에 연결하기 (최대 3대)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontSize=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="110" width="216" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="BT 3/3" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Courier New;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="183" y="112" width="93" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="2:14" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Courier New;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=20;fontSize=30;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="183" y="145" width="93" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="[5m]" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Courier New;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="183" y="195" width="93" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="" style="shape=mxgraph.basic.pie;html=1;startAngle=0.55;endAngle=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="63" y="113" width="108" height="108" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="63" y="113" width="108" height="108" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="&lt;b&gt;회사 PC (Windows)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="80" width="300" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="&lt;b&gt;개인 노트북 (macOS)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="170" width="300" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="Shift" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="&lt;b&gt;회의실 PC&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="260" width="300" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c14"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="• 각 PC에서 한 번씩 페어링하면 됩니다. 연결 중에도 다른 PC가 장치를 찾을 수 있습니다.&lt;br&gt;• Shift는 연결된 &lt;b&gt;모든 PC에 같은 순간&lt;/b&gt; 전송됩니다. 타이머는 하나입니다.&lt;br&gt;• 3대가 모두 연결되면 더 이상 보이지 않습니다. 한 대가 끊기면 다시 보입니다." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="300" width="900" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
